  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   picopi
   arch    armv6m
   cpu     rp2040
   mpu     enforce
   sched   tickless

[ringpriv]   CONTROL=0x3
[ringpriv] ok - CONTROL.nPRIV=1: unprivileged, and off its reset value (a priv msr landed)
[ringpriv] ok - CONTROL.SPSEL=1: on SP_process, a second bit off reset
[ringpriv] skip - the msr/mrs arms need armv7m assembler syntax (APSR_nzcvq)
[ringpriv] PASS (2 arms)
